    title: "Grillo Fencing",
    description: "The Grillo fencing system provide extra privacy, in style with your veranda. The fence parts can also be installed as sidewall or rear wall in every veranda and as front shielding under a polycarbonate side wall The components are stackable and can be fitted with click profiles. Like a Lego system with the Grillo fencing you can build anything from side gable, full wall, garden fencing and even planters!",
