    features: ["LED lighting integrated in the gutter as standard","Large slats for extra strength","Large span of 7 meters on 2 posts/freestanding on 4 posts","Maximum open space thanks to compact folding"],
    specs: [{"label":"Colours","value":"Traffic white texturized (RAL9016) / Grey texturized (RAL7024) / Black (RAL9005"},{"label":"Width (mm)","value":"3124 / 3445 / 4088 / 5052 / 6016 / 6980"},{"label":"Projection (mm)","value":"3000 / 3500 / 4000 / 4500"},{"label":"Lighting","value":"LED lighting supplied as standard in the gutter"},{"label":"Slats","value":"It is possible to slide the slats to one side to create an open space above your terrace. With the included SOMFY remote control, the slats of the Pinela Deluxe Plus and the LED lighting can be controlled."},{"label":"Optional","value":"SOMFY (IO control)"},{"label":"Applications","value":"Can be installed both as a wall model and freestanding"}],
