    collectionSlug: "accessories",
    slug: "screen",
    title: "Screen",
    description: "With the Screens within the Pinela Series, a new dimension of comfort is created. They soften the light, reduce the wind and provide privacy without losing the connection to the outdoors. Perfectly balanced with the architecture of the outdoor space. For those who do not leave comfort to chance. For those who value every detail. When the sun is high, the Screens filter daylight into a pleasant glow. No harsh contrast, but a gentle transition between inside and outside. When evening falls or the wind rises, they subtly enclose the space. Moving silently with intuitive control. The housing integrates seamlessly with the frame. The anthracite coloured fabric radiates calm, both on the inside and the outside. The result: a fully integrated solution for the moments when the sun is welcome. Just slightly softer.",
