    description: "A side gable is used to partially close the sides of you veranda when it for instance is next to a fence or wall, these side gables are designed to cover the sloped part between the veranda roof and the top of the side wall. The side gable is made of an aluminium frame and 16mm thick polycarbonate, but a safety glass version is possible as well. For the frame, you can choose from the colours traffic white texturized (RAL9016), cream white (RAL9001) or grey texturized (RAL7024), depending on the colour of your veranda. You can easily add the side gable to your order, but you can also install it later. The side gable can be installed to all types of verandas we have.",
